  "method": "linearized spatial eigenvalues about u0: cubic in K=k^2 from (Du K+a)(1-tau Dv K)(1-th Dw K)-k3(1-th Dw K)-k4(1-tau Dv K)=0; oscillatory tails when complex k dominates (Re k smallest)",
  "M0": "mono-dominant: mono_decay 2.51 > osc_decay 2.20, wl 10.8 -- weak oscillatory subdominant tail",
  "P7 (Dv=2)": "mono_decay 2.96 vs osc_decay 2.77, wl 11.0; tail oscillation strengthened vs M0",
  "note": "strictly osc-dominant points (e.g. Dv>=4,k3=1.5,k4=1.0; or k4->1.7-1.9) all FAILED single/pair (huge blobs, replication cascades); working binding found in mono-marginal zone"
 },
